        You grant ATW a limited license to host, process, transmit, display, and otherwise use Customer Data solely as needed to provide, maintain, secure, and improve the services, to prevent or address service or technical issues, and as otherwise directed by you or required by law. Our handling of personal data is further described in our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-primary underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
        You are responsible for the accuracy and lawfulness of Customer Data and for obtaining any consents needed to use the services with that data. We treat Customer Data as confidential and do not sell it. We may use aggregated or de-identified information that does not identify you or your end users for analytics, capacity planning, and product improvement.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
        Upon written request after termination, and subject to legal retention requirements and technical feasibility, we will make Customer Data available for export for a reasonable period, then delete or de-identify it according to our standard practices.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-xl border border-border p-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">6. Fees, Credits, and billing</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
        Paid plans, Credits pools, self-serve Credit purchases, trials, and add-ons are described on our pricing and product pages or in an order form or invoice we issue. Fees and included Credits depend on the plan and options you select. We do not invent or guarantee specific prices in these Terms; current commercial terms are those shown at purchase or in your organization's billing settings.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
        Credits are a usage unit for applicable ATW products. Usage may draw from a shared organization Credits pool across apps, mail inboxes, storage, automations, AI, and Workforce. Additional Credits may be purchased self-serve or as otherwise offered in billing settings, at the rates then in effect. A detailed Credit rate sheet may be published separately; these Terms do not freeze specific per-meter rates.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
        Unless otherwise stated, fees are billed in advance for the subscription period, exclusive of taxes. You authorize ATW (and our payment processors) to charge the payment method on file. Late or failed payments may result in suspension. Except where required by law or expressly stated otherwise, fees are non-refundable.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
        Trials are limited (for example, one trial per organization domain where that policy applies). Trial access, included apps, and Credits are described at signup and on our pricing pages. After the trial period, access to trial apps may continue subject to Credits and self-serve purchase options then in effect; we do not lock trial apps to read-only solely because the trial window ended. ATW pricing is organization hosting plus Credits with unlimited named seats; we do not charge a separate per-user ATW Orbit seat fee.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-xl border border-border p-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">7. Communications and SMS</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
        We may send service, security, billing, and account messages by email or in-product notification. These operational messages are part of providing the services and are not optional while your account remains active, except where law requires otherwise.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
