      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
        TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, ATW'S TOTAL LIABILITY ARISING OUT OF OR RELATED TO THESE TERMS OR THE SERVICES WILL NOT EXCEED THE AMOUNTS YOU PAID TO ATW FOR THE SERVICES IN THE TWELVE (12) MONTHS BEFORE THE EVENT GIVING RISE TO LIABILITY. IF YOU HAVE NOT PAID FEES IN THAT PERIOD, ATW'S TOTAL LIABILITY WILL NOT EXCEED ONE HUNDRED U.S. DOLLARS (US $100).
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
        Some jurisdictions do not allow certain disclaimers or limitations. In those cases, the limitation applies to the fullest extent permitted by applicable law.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-xl border border-border p-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">10. Suspension and termination</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
        You may stop using the services at any time and may cancel according to the cancellation controls in your account or by contacting support. We may suspend or terminate access immediately if you breach these Terms, fail to pay fees when due, create risk to the platform or other customers, or if we are required to do so by law.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
