      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
        Questions about these Terms:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-none space-y-2 text-muted-foreground">
        <li>Email: <a href="mailto:support@atw.net" class="text-primary underline">support@atw.net</a></li>
        <li>Phone: <a href="tel:+13303332256" class="text-primary underline">+1 (330) 333-2256</a></li>
        <li>Web: <a href="/contact" class="text-primary underline">Contact form</a></li>
        <li>Mail: No Name Marketing, LLC d/b/a ATW.Net, 13940 Cedar Rd 438, University Heights, OH 44118-3204, USA</li>
      </ul>
